o.com%2Fbh3-wiki%2F2021%2F09%2F10%2F50494840%2Fb38a771958bf8fd53aec59ae7c9bc8e0_8620349406547025019.gif%22%2C%22desc%22%3A%22%3Cp%20style%3D%5C%22white-space%3A%20pre-wrap%3B%5C%22%3E%E7%9C%9F%E7%82%8E%E5%B9%B8%E9%AD%82%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%AF%95%E4%B8%9A%E6%AD%A6%E5%99%A8%E3%80%82%E4%B8%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E9%80%A0%E6%88%90%E5%8F%AF%E8%A7%82%E7%81%AB%E4%BC%A4%E7%9A%84%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E8%BF%98%E8%83%BD%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E7%9C%9F%E7%82%8E%E5%B9%B8%E9%AD%82%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%94%AF%E8%BF%BD%E5%87%BB%E6%98%93%E4%BC%A4%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%97%A0%E8%AE%BA%E6%98%AF%E8%87%AA%E8%BA%AB%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%88%96%E6%98%AF%E8%BE%85%E5%8A%A9%E7%81%AB%E4%BC%A4%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E9%83%BD%E8%83%BD%E8%B5%B7%E5%88%B0%E6%98%8E%E6%98%BE%E4%BD%9C%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%E8%A2%AB%E5%8A%A8%E6%97%A0%E6%9D%A1%E4%BB%B6%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%87%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E7%9A%84%E7%81%AB%E4%BC%A4%EF%BC%8C%E7%A2%8D%E4%BA%8E%E5%A4%AA%E5%88%80%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8F%AA%E6%9C%89%E7%9C%9F%E7%82%8E%E6%98%AF%E7%81%AB%E4%BC%A4%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E5%A4%AA%E9%80%82%E5%90%88%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%A4%AA%E5%88%80%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E3%80%82%E8%B6%85%E9%99%90%E5%90%8E%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E8%A6%86%E7%9B%96%E7%9A%84%E6%98%93%E4%BC%A4%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%8F%90%E9%AB%98%E7%9C%9F%E7%82%8E%E7%88%86%E5%8F%91%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%EF%BC%8C%E6%AF%94%E8%BE%83%E6%8E%A8%E8%8D%90%E3%80%82%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1635846107472\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/30/50494840/31d568e50157a0fd9760751ede8cd2b2_4914369575420344449.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>真幸炎魂</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用主动提供易伤，被动有不错的火焰伤害加成。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/50494840/b38a771958bf8fd53aec59ae7c9bc8e0_8620349406547025019.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">真炎幸魂一般毕业武器。主动技能造成可观火伤的同时还能覆盖真炎幸魂的分支追击易伤效果，无论是自身输出或是辅助火伤角色都能起到明显作用。被动无条件提升角色的火伤，碍于太刀角色只有真炎是火伤输出，不太适合其他太刀角色使用。超限后提高覆盖的易伤效果，提高真炎爆发的总输出，比较推荐。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/50494840/b38a771958bf8fd53aec59ae7c9bc8e0_8620349406547025019.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
